  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "R के साथ सांख्यिकी",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "r",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 18,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# R के साथ सांख्यिकी\n\nR के अंतर्निहित डेटासेट का उपयोग करके परिकल्पना परीक्षण, प्रतिगमन (regression), और विश्वास अंतराल (confidence intervals)।\n\nकिसी डेटा डाउनलोड या पैकेज स्थापना की आवश्यकता नहीं है — केवल बेस R का उपयोग करता है।",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## 1. विवरणात्मक सांख्यिकी",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "data(mtcars)\ncat(\"डेटासेट: mtcars (\", nrow(mtcars), \" कारें, \", ncol(mtcars), \" चर)\\n\\n\")\nsummary(mtcars[, c(\"mpg\", \"hp\", \"wt\", \"disp\")])",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "डेटासेट: mtcars ( 32  कारें,  11  चर)\n\n      mpg              hp              wt             disp      \n Min.   :10.40   Min.   : 52.0   Min.   :1.513   Min.   : 71.1  \n 1st Qu.:15.43   1st Qu.: 96.5   1st Qu.:2.581   1st Qu.:120.8  \n Median :19.20   Median :123.0   Median :3.325   Median :196.3  \n Mean   :20.09   Mean   :146.7   Mean   :3.217   Mean   :230.7  \n 3rd Qu.:22.80   3rd Qu.:180.0   3rd Qu.:3.610   3rd Qu.:326.0  \n Max.   :33.90   Max.   :335.0   Max.   :5.424   Max.   :472.0",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">डेटासेट: mtcars ( 32  कारें,  11  चर)\n\n      mpg              hp              wt             disp      \n Min.   :10.40   Min.   : 52.0   Min.   :1.513   Min.   : 71.1  \n 1st Qu.:15.43   1st Qu.: 96.5   1st Qu.:2.581   1st Qu.:120.8  \n Median :19.20   Median :123.0   Median :3.325   Median :196.3  \n Mean   :20.09   Mean   :146.7   Mean   :3.217   Mean   :230.7  \n 3rd Qu.:22.80   3rd Qu.:180.0   3rd Qu.:3.610   3rd Qu.:326.0  \n Max.   :33.90   Max.   :335.0   Max.   :5.424   Max.   :472.0</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## 2. दो-नमूना टी-परीक्षण (Two-Sample t-Test)\n\nक्या मैनुअल ट्रांसमिशन वाली कारों का ईंधन माइलेज (MPG) स्वचालित कारों की तुलना में बेहतर है?",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "auto <- mtcars$mpg[mtcars$am == 0]\nmanual <- mtcars$mpg[mtcars$am == 1]\n\ncat(\"स्वचालित:\", round(mean(auto), 1), \"MPG (n =\", length(auto), \")\\n\")\ncat(\"मैन्युअल:   \", round(mean(manual), 1), \"MPG (n =\", length(manual), \")\\n\\n\")\n\nt_result <- t.test(manual, auto, alternative = \"greater\")\nprint(t_result)\n\ncat(\"\\nनिष्कर्ष:\",\n    ifelse(t_result$p.value < 0.05,\n           \"H0 को अस्वीकार करें — मैनुअल कारों का MPG काफी अधिक है\",\n           \"H0 को अस्वीकार करने में विफल\"))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "स्वचालित: 17.1 MPG (n = 19 )\nमैन्युअल:    24.4 MPG (n = 13 )\n\n\n\tWelch Two Sample t-test\n\ndata:  manual and auto\nt = 3.7671, df = 18.332, p-value = 0.0006868\nalternative hypothesis: true difference in means is greater than 0\n95 percent confidence interval:\n 3.913256      Inf\nsample estimates:\nmean of x mean of y \n 24.39231  17.14737 \n\n\nनिष्कर्ष: H0 को अस्वीकार करें — मैनुअल कारों का MPG काफी अधिक है",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">स्वचालित: 17.1 MPG (n = 19 )\nमैन्युअल:    24.4 MPG (n = 13 )\n\n\n\tWelch Two Sample t-test\n\ndata:  manual and auto\nt = 3.7671, df = 18.332, p-value = 0.0006868\nalternative hypothesis: true difference in means is greater than 0\n95 percent confidence interval:\n 3.913256      Inf\nsample estimates:\nmean of x mean of y \n 24.39231  17.14737 \n\n\nनिष्कर्ष: H0 को अस्वीकार करें — मैनुअल कारों का MPG काफी अधिक है</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "## 3. काई-स्क्वायर परीक्षण (Chi-Square Test)\n\nक्या सिलेंडर की संख्या और ट्रांसमिशन का प्रकार स्वतंत्र हैं?",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "tab <- table(Cylinders = mtcars$cyl, Transmission = mtcars$am)\ncolnames(tab) <- c(\"स्वचालित\", \"मैन्युअल\")\nprint(tab)\ncat(\"\\n\")\nchisq.test(tab)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "         Transmission\nCylinders स्वचालित मैन्युअल\n        4       3     8\n        6       4     3\n        8      12     2\n\nWarning in chisq.test(tab) : Chi-squared approximation may be incorrect\n\n\tPearson's Chi-squared test\n\ndata:  tab\nX-squared = 8.7407, df = 2, p-value = 0.01265",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">         Transmission\nCylinders स्वचालित मैन्युअल\n        4       3     8\n        6       4     3\n        8      12     2\n\nWarning in chisq.test(tab) : Chi-squared approximation may be incorrect\n\n\tPearson's Chi-squared test\n\ndata:  tab\nX-squared = 8.7407, df = 2, p-value = 0.01265</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "## 4. एकाधिक रैखिक प्रतिगमन (Multiple Linear Regression)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "model <- lm(mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\nsummary(model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "\nCall:\nlm(formula = mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\n\nResiduals:\n    Min      1Q  Median      3Q     Max \n-3.4221 -1.7924 -0.3788  1.2249  5.5317 \n\nCoefficients:\n             Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(>|t|)    \n(Intercept) 34.002875   2.642659  12.867 2.82e-13 ***\nwt          -2.878575   0.904971  -3.181 0.003574 ** \nhp          -0.037479   0.009605  -3.902 0.000546 ***\nam           2.083710   1.376420   1.514 0.141268    \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nResidual standard error: 2.538 on 28 degrees of freedom\nMultiple R-squared:  0.8399,\tAdjusted R-squared:  0.8227 \nF-statistic: 48.96 on 3 and 28 DF,  p-value: 2.908e-11",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">\nCall:\nlm(formula = mpg ~ wt + hp + am, data = mtcars)\n\nResiduals:\n    Min      1Q  Median      3Q     Max \n-3.4221 -1.7924 -0.3788  1.2249  5.5317 \n\nCoefficients:\n             Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(&gt;|t|)    \n(Intercept) 34.002875   2.642659  12.867 2.82e-13 ***\nwt          -2.878575   0.904971  -3.181 0.003574 ** \nhp          -0.037479   0.009605  -3.902 0.000546 ***\nam           2.083710   1.376420   1.514 0.141268    \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nResidual standard error: 2.538 on 28 degrees of freedom\nMultiple R-squared:  0.8399,\tAdjusted R-squared:  0.8227 \nF-statistic: 48.96 on 3 and 28 DF,  p-value: 2.908e-11</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "## 5. प्रतिगमन निदान (Regression Diagnostics)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "par(mfrow = c(2, 2))\nplot(model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/39e08689-781e-4a42-9e55-260dd9404554\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "## 6. विश्वास अंतराल (Confidence Intervals)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "ci <- confint(model, level = 0.95)\ncat(\"95% विश्वास अंतराल:\\n\")\nprint(round(ci, 4))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "95% विश्वास अंतराल:\n              2.5 %  97.5 %\n(Intercept) 28.5896 39.4161\nwt          -4.7323 -1.0248\nhp          -0.0572 -0.0178\nam          -0.7358  4.9032",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">95% विश्वास अंतराल:\n              2.5 %  97.5 %\n(Intercept) 28.5896 39.4161\nwt          -4.7323 -1.0248\nhp          -0.0572 -0.0178\nam          -0.7358  4.9032</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "coefs <- coef(model)[-1]\nci_vals <- ci[-1, ]\nn <- length(coefs)\n\npar(mfrow = c(1, 1), mar = c(5, 8, 4, 2))\nplot(coefs, 1:n, xlim = range(ci_vals),\n     pch = 19, col = \"#58a6ff\", cex = 1.5,\n     yaxt = \"n\", xlab = \"अनुमान\", ylab = \"\",\n     main = \"गुणांकों के लिए 95% विश्वास अंतराल\")\naxis(2, at = 1:n, labels = names(coefs), las = 1)\nsegments(ci_vals[, 1], 1:n, ci_vals[, 2], 1:n,\n         lwd = 3, col = \"#58a6ff\")\nabline(v = 0, lty = 2, col = \"#f85149\", lwd = 1.5)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/c8ae225f-607e-4fb7-b72c-1b4847d1baf5\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "## 7. वन-वे एनोवा (One-Way ANOVA)\n\nक्या सिलेंडर गणनाओं के बीच माइलेज (MPG) में महत्वपूर्ण अंतर है?",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "anova_model <- aov(mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\nsummary(anova_model)\ncat(\"\\nTukey HSD पोस्ट-हॉक तुलना:\\n\")\nTukeyHSD(anova_model)",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "            Df Sum Sq Mean Sq F value   Pr(>F)    \nfactor(cyl)  2  824.8   412.4    39.7 4.98e-09 ***\nResiduals   29  301.3    10.4                     \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nTukey HSD पोस्ट-हॉक तुलना:\n  Tukey multiple comparisons of means\n    95% family-wise confidence level\n\nFit: aov(formula = mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\n\n$`factor(cyl)`\n          diff        lwr        upr     p adj\n6-4  -6.920779 -10.769350 -3.0722086 0.0003424\n8-4 -11.563636 -14.770779 -8.3564942 0.0000000\n8-6  -4.642857  -8.327583 -0.9581313 0.0112287",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">            Df Sum Sq Mean Sq F value   Pr(&gt;F)    \nfactor(cyl)  2  824.8   412.4    39.7 4.98e-09 ***\nResiduals   29  301.3    10.4                     \n---\nSignif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1\n\nTukey HSD पोस्ट-हॉक तुलना:\n  Tukey multiple comparisons of means\n    95% family-wise confidence level\n\nFit: aov(formula = mpg ~ factor(cyl), data = mtcars)\n\n$`factor(cyl)`\n          diff        lwr        upr     p adj\n6-4  -6.920779 -10.769350 -3.0722086 0.0003424\n8-4 -11.563636 -14.770779 -8.3564942 0.0000000\n8-6  -4.642857  -8.327583 -0.9581313 0.0112287</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "boxplot(mpg ~ cyl, data = mtcars,\n        main = \"सिलेंडर गणना के अनुसार MPG\",\n        xlab = \"सिलेंडर\", ylab = \"मील प्रति गैलन\",\n        col = c(\"#58a6ff\", \"#a371f7\", \"#f85149\"))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/fd2f39fe-f175-48be-9e87-eb9de65a2ee0\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "## सारांश\n\n- **वेल्च टी-परीक्षण**: असमायोजित एकतरफा तुलना में, मैनुअल कारों का औसत MPG अधिक होता है\n- **काई-स्क्वायर**: आकस्मिकता तालिका एक जुड़ाव का सुझाव देती है लेकिन कम अपेक्षित गणनाएं एक अनुमान चेतावनी ट्रिगर करती हैं, इसलिए इस परिणाम की सावधानीपूर्वक व्याख्या करें\n- **प्रतिगमन**: समायोजन के बाद वजन और हॉर्सपावर महत्वपूर्ण नकारात्मक भविष्यवक्ता हैं; ट्रांसमिशन प्रकार इस मॉडल में महत्वपूर्ण नहीं है\n- **एनोवा**: 4, 6, और 8-सिलेंडर समूहों के बीच MPG महत्वपूर्ण रूप से भिन्न होता है; टुकी परिणाम युग्मित अंतरों की पहचान करते हैं",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}